{"lesson_uid":"L0157","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"2d4d4c9f1d0ec1a6","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":182,"chars":5108,"poly_positions":1497,"he_adjudicated":4,"xiang_adjudicated":0,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"nvrme","idx":1,"text":"表1右欄中的白話文，連標點符號一共用了343字；左欄的文言文，連標點符號只用了195個字。讀完了以後，你會不會有一個疑問──「白話文比較容易懂吔，為什麼古人要用大家不容易懂的文言文寫文章啊？」","n":96,"ssz":"...............1.....................................1...1...............1......................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"nvrme","idx":2,"text":"好問題！其實，對古人來說，白話文是日常的口語，也是比較容易懂的。但是，用白話文寫作的話，難免用上太多的字，古時候寫字要用毛筆，很不方便；紙還沒發明時，更不方便，還要用刀把字刻在竹簡上，印刷的門檻就更高了，現代人家家有印表機，在沒有電腦的時代，一般人想都別想。因為書寫、記錄和印刷都太麻煩、花太多時間、太花錢，因此可以大幅精簡文字的文言文應運而生。從西漢算起，文言文已經有兩千多年的歷史了，一直到100年前左右，紙、筆、印刷都更普遍之後，才開始有人推廣白話文。","n":229,"ssz":"....................................................................................1....................................2........1.....1...............................1.........................2.................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"nvrme","idx":3,"text":"Ｑ１：文言文在哪裡節省用字？","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"nvrme","idx":4,"text":"文言文節省用字，提高了閱讀的門檻，所以，讀文言文時必須強調「腦補」，讀者要試著推敲出被省略的部分，動動腦筋，把它補上。例如，道士說的「不可救」，猜猜看是誰不可救？你可以腦補出來嗎？","n":90,"ssz":"............................1..................1.........................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"nvrme","idx":5,"text":"除了用字精簡外，文言文另一個難讀的地方是因時代更迭，這麼多年之後，古人的用詞和今人已經有了差異。例如，「起視仲肩」的「仲」，指的是一群兄弟中，排行老二的人，在這篇文言文裡就是「弟弟」的意思，現代已經少有人知道「仲」有弟弟的意思。又如「力不得肆」的「肆」，意思是「施展」，老虎的力氣施展不出來，「肆」有「施展」的意思，現代人也幾乎不用了。其他如「負其弟疾奔下嶺」的「負」，就是「背書包」的「背」；「一息未殊」的「殊」，就是「斷絕」的意思。這些古人的用詞，增加了現代人閱讀的難度。還好，國、高中國文課本裡的文言文，對這些生字難字古字都有注釋，看一下注釋，就可以知道這些字詞的意思了。","n":289,"ssz":".............1.........1..............1.................................1................1...2...............1..2......1........2...........................2.....1.1...................................................2.....................................................1...............2.."},{"section":"served:lesson_code","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文-L2","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文怎麼讀？以鞭虎救弟記為例","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文閱讀策略──如何讀懂文言文","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要學會「讀懂古早的中文」，也就是文言文\n文章一開始會告訴你文言文為什麼會出現，接著用《鞭虎救弟記》這個故事，讓你看看古人怎麼寫文章，還有為什麼讀起來會有點卡住\n所以讀的時候，你可以試著想想文字背後的意思，還有現在的說法有什麼不一樣，就能慢慢讀通囉","n":128,"ssz":".1.........................2.........1.................1.................1...............................2............1........."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要學會「讀懂古早的中文」，也就是文言文","n":24,"ssz":".1......................"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章一開始會告訴你文言文為什麼會出現，接著用《鞭虎救弟記》這個故事，讓你看看古人怎麼寫文章，還有為什麼讀起來會有點卡住","n":59,"ssz":"..2.........1.................1.................1.........."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"所以讀的時候，你可以試著想想文字背後的意思，還有現在的說法有什麼不一樣，就能慢慢讀通囉","n":43,"ssz":"....................2............1........."},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章要帶大家一起認識文言文。為什麼古人要用文言文寫作，而不是我們現在常用的白話文呢？文章會從書寫、記錄和印刷的便利性來解釋文言文的由來。接著，文章會探討文言文閱讀起來比較困難的原因，像是用字精簡需要讀者「腦補」推敲，以及古人的用詞和現代的差異。透過《鞭虎救弟記》這個例子，你會更了解文言文的特色和閱讀方法。","n":155,"ssz":"........2.......1.............1......................1...............................................................1................1.1....1.......1....."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"以「鞭虎救弟記」為例，文言文比白話文少了148字，作者主要用了三個方式節省用字：","n":40,"ssz":"................................1......."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用詞精簡：「弟弟」在文言文裡只剩「弟」；「老虎的牙齒」只剩「虎牙」；弟弟被灌了湯藥後，「徐甦」。「徐」有「慢慢的」意思，「甦」則是甦醒。因此，「徐甦」就是弟弟「慢慢的清醒過來」，省了５個字呢。","n":96,"ssz":".......1...........................1......................2...................1................."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[5]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"省略主詞或受詞：如果句子的主詞或受詞是可以推敲出來的，文言文往往就省略不寫了。例如，「虎牙有毒，深入，惡血不盡出，不可救。」這裡「深入」的主詞指的是什麼？當然是虎牙的毒，但虎牙的毒會深入哪裡呢？當然是深入傷者的身體囉，這裡也省略了受詞不寫。作者表達「虎牙的毒深入傷者體內」時，把「虎牙的毒」和「傷者體內」都省略了，因為這些訊息是可以推敲出來的。","n":172,"ssz":"...........1.........................................1...........................................................................................1............1............."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[6]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"省略連接詞：連接詞就是「讓前後文可以更有意義串連在一起」的詞彙，例如，然後、因為、所以、於是、如果、就、才等詞彙，都是文言文裡非常少用的連接詞。像「惡血不盡出，不可救」其實是「惡血（如果）不完全排出，（就）沒救了。」，「如果」和「就」被省略了。","n":122,"ssz":".........................2.............1....................................1....................................1........"},{"section":"served:paragraphs[8]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"Ｑ2：文言文一堆生字、難字、古字怎麼辦？","n":20,"ssz":"......2............."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀全文-做記號","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"古今對照表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文聚光燈","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如何讀懂文言文","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列文句，何者語詞使用最恰當？","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小朋友被路上的石頭絆倒「墜地」，痛得哇哇大哭","n":22,"ssz":"........1.1......1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為了這場比賽，他練習游泳許久，在泳池中大汗「淋漓」","n":25,"ssz":"1........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他看起來很面熟，我苦思良久，「俄而」才喚出他的名字","n":25,"ssz":"........................1"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"街頭畫家掌握模特兒的神韻，運筆「疾速」，完成畫像","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀完本篇課文，請問有關「文言文」的敘述，何者為不正確？","n":28,"ssz":"........................1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文的出現是為了要記錄古代的生難字，以供後人閱讀","n":25,"ssz":".......1................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為古代書寫成本很高，文言文大幅精簡了需要紀錄的文字","n":26,"ssz":".1........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文是書面用語，和古人平常說話的方式有所不同","n":23,"ssz":".........1............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"精簡文字的方式有精簡用詞、省略主詞和受詞及省略連接詞","n":26,"ssz":".................1........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列選項，何者無法證明含光與老虎歷經一番搏鬥？","n":23,"ssz":"..................2...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"左手據虎頸，右手以鞭亂捶虎頭，呼號聲震山谷","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"含光喘亦略定，起視仲肩，前後十餘孔，血淋漓滿地","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"虎怒，力不得肆，舍其弟據嵎而吼，將以搏含光","n":21,"ssz":".....1..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"猛虎攫其弟去。含光大驚墜地，持短鞭力追","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列何者是作者(曾世杰)想要學生學到的概念？","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"宣揚文言文寫作之美，推廣文言文","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"說明文言文中生字、難字、古字的字義","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"告訴讀者文言文的由來以及閱讀的策略","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"說明文言文傳承古人智慧，現代人不可不學","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（w:sym Wingdings F0FE）＋ 橘色手寫（**字元樣式 af**，色 E97132，run 層掃不到）\n＋ 紅色手繪連線（4 條，PDF 上看不見，只在 XML）","n":93,"ssz":"............................................................1......................1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（w:sym Wingdings F0FE）＋ 橘色手寫（**字元樣式 af**，色 E97132，run 層掃不到）","n":63,"ssz":"............................................................1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＋ 紅色手繪連線（4 條，PDF 上看不見，只在 XML）","n":29,"ssz":"...................1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看完了這篇文章，你是否對文言文有更深一層了解呢？其實，古人平時講話也是講「白話文」，就是淺白的話語；至於書寫，因為寫字印刷成本太高，則使用「文言文」，所以「文言文」是寫文章使用的語言。現在，就讓我們一起練習文言文怎麼讀吧！","n":111,"ssz":"....................1...................................1..........................................2..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.用故事情節來推測：\n我們來讀＜狐假虎威＞這篇文言文。這是一個故事，故事通常會有「角色」和「角色間發生的事」，只要讀懂了他們的關係，即使有些文句不懂，也經常可以推測出七、八成了。","n":90,"ssz":"...............................1..........1..1.1.........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.用故事情節來推測：","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們來讀＜狐假虎威＞這篇文言文。這是一個故事，故事通常會有「角色」和「角色間發生的事」，只要讀懂了他們的關係，即使有些文句不懂，也經常可以推測出七、八成了。","n":78,"ssz":"...................1..........1..1.1.........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"今天的白話文","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"虎求百獸而食之，得狐。\n狐曰：「子無敢食我也，天帝使我長百獸，今子食我，是逆天帝之命也。子以我為不信，吾為子先行，子隨我後，觀百獸之見我而敢不走乎？」\n虎以為然，故遂與之行。獸見之皆走。虎不知獸畏己而走也，以為畏狐也。","n":109,"ssz":"........1.......1...............1...........1...1....1...1..................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][0]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"虎求百獸而食之，得狐。","n":11,"ssz":"........1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][0]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"狐曰：「子無敢食我也，天帝使我長百獸，今子食我，是逆天帝之命也。子以我為不信，吾為子先行，子隨我後，觀百獸之見我而敢不走乎？」","n":63,"ssz":"....1...............1...........1...1....1...1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][0]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"虎以為然，故遂與之行。獸見之皆走。虎不知獸畏己而走也，以為畏狐也。","n":33,"ssz":"................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老虎獵捕百獸當食物，有一次抓到一隻狐狸。\n狐狸說：「你不敢吃我啦，天帝命令我掌管百獸，現在你吃我，就是違背天帝的命令。你如果認為我的話不可信，我可以走在你前面，你跟在我後面，你看看其他的野獸看到我，有誰敢不逃跑？」\nＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯ ＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯ。（老虎認為狐狸的話很有道理，所以就跟著他走，結果野獸們看到老虎走在狐狸後面，全都嚇得逃走了。）老虎不知道野獸們是因為害怕自己而逃跑，還以為他們是怕狐狸呢！","n":221,"ssz":"...............2.........................................................................................................................................................................1...............1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][1]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老虎獵捕百獸當食物，有一次抓到一隻狐狸。","n":20,"ssz":"...............2...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][1]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"狐狸說：「你不敢吃我啦，天帝命令我掌管百獸，現在你吃我，就是違背天帝的命令。你如果認為我的話不可信，我可以走在你前面，你跟在我後面，你看看其他的野獸看到我，有誰敢不逃跑？」","n":86,"ssz":"......................................................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0][1]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"ＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯ ＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯＯ。（老虎認為狐狸的話很有道理，所以就跟著他走，結果野獸們看到老虎走在狐狸後面，全都嚇得逃走了。）老虎不知道野獸們是因為害怕自己而逃跑，還以為他們是怕狐狸呢！","n":113,"ssz":".............................................................................1...............1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.讀懂文言文的代名詞\n(1)上述故事中的角色有老虎、狐狸、百獸。\n(2)文言文為了節省用字，會出現很多代名詞，這篇文章裡出現多次的代名詞有「子、之」，「子」就是「您」的意思；「之」就是「他、牠或牠們」的意思。\n(3)現在請你把本文中的「子、之」先用螢光筆畫起來。並連連看，配對出正確的意思。（其中有複選）可以對照旁邊的白話文喔。","n":165,"ssz":".....................1..................1.............................................2................2........................................2..................1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.讀懂文言文的代名詞","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1)上述故事中的角色有老虎、狐狸、百獸。","n":21,"ssz":".........1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(2)文言文為了節省用字，會出現很多代名詞，這篇文章裡出現多次的代名詞有「子、之」，「子」就是「您」的意思；「之」就是「他、牠或牠們」的意思。","n":71,"ssz":"......1.............................................2................2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(3)現在請你把本文中的「子、之」先用螢光筆畫起來。並連連看，配對出正確的意思。（其中有複選）可以對照旁邊的白話文喔。","n":59,"ssz":"......................................2..................1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"連連看，配對出正確的意思。（其中有複選）","n":20,"ssz":"...........2........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].left.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"虎以為然，故遂與「之」行。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].left.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"吾為「子」先行","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].left.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"虎求百獸而食「之」","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].left.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"獸見「之」皆走","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].right.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"代名詞，在此指百獸","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].right.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"代名詞，在此指老虎","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].right.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"代名詞，在此指狐狸","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色手繪連線（4 條 `srgbClr FF0000` 的 line 圖形），文字流無此資訊","n":46,"ssz":".............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你發現了嗎？文言文有很多代名詞，可以先找到有什麼人物，這些代名詞指的是誰，就比較容易讀懂文章在說什麼。","n":51,"ssz":"..................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.遇到不認識的詞怎麼辦？\n懂了文言文的代名詞，就可以讀懂句意，但如果還有不認識的詞，怎麼辦呢？你可以試著根據上下文及推測字義。例如下句，「逆」天帝之命，我們可以猜是「違逆」。再帶回原句裡讀是否通順。現在換你試試看。","n":108,"ssz":"....1................................1......................................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.遇到不認識的詞怎麼辦？","n":13,"ssz":"....1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"懂了文言文的代名詞，就可以讀懂句意，但如果還有不認識的詞，怎麼辦呢？你可以試著根據上下文及推測字義。例如下句，「逆」天帝之命，我們可以猜是「違逆」。再帶回原句裡讀是否通順。現在換你試試看。","n":94,"ssz":".......................1......................................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例句：「虎以為然，故遂與之行。獸見之皆走。」","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"行：【　】，見：【　】，皆：【　】，走：【　】。","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"同行/行動","n":5,"ssz":".1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看見","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].blanks[2].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].blanks[3].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"逃走/走開","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫（字元樣式 af），文字流有此資訊","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎小試身手：選擇題","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫代號（字元樣式 af），文字流有此資訊","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"天帝「使」我長百獸","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"擅長","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"命令","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"增加","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"使用","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[1].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"虎不知獸「畏」己而走也","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[1].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"尊敬","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[1].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"擔心","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[1].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"危險","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[1].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"害怕","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"子「隨」我後","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"跟隨","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"追隨","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"隨便","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"隨意","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.全句翻譯：\n懂了文言文的代名詞，也能推測出不認識的字的意思，你應該就可以理解句義了。請勾選出「虎以為然，故遂與之行。獸見之皆走。」的正確翻譯。","n":73,"ssz":".......................1......2.........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.全句翻譯：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"懂了文言文的代名詞，也能推測出不認識的字的意思，你應該就可以理解句義了。請勾選出「虎以為然，故遂與之行。獸見之皆走。」的正確翻譯。","n":65,"ssz":"...............1......2.........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老虎認為狐狸的話很有道理，所以就跟著他走，野獸看到老虎走在狐狸後面，全都嚇得逃走了。","n":42,"ssz":".....................................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老虎認為狐狸在騙人，所以就想看看狐狸要做什麼行為，野獸看到老虎後，全都嚇得逃走了。","n":41,"ssz":"....................................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"5.讀出作者意圖：試試看，從文中角色的關係，推論作者意圖：（單選）","n":33,"ssz":"................1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[0].sub_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"野獸們怕的是誰？","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[0].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"野獸們怕的是誰？（　），因為會害怕被牠吃掉。","n":22,"ssz":".............1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老虎","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[0].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"狐狸","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[1].sub_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"狐狸藉著老虎讓自己看來很厲害，讓野獸們紛紛走避。","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[1].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→所以作者藉這個故事諷刺那些沒有真本事的小人，藉著大人物的權勢，提高自己的地位。","n":40,"ssz":".......1................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 小試身手：綜合測驗","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].passage","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下課返家，事雜頗繁。舍弟閒置於椅，無所事事；喚，無動於衷；家嚴(父親)後至咱旁，無視其閒散，喚我做事。心偏之劣，厚此薄彼，吾欲哭無淚，憤恨難平。","n":72,"ssz":"........................................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（4 個）＋ 橘色手寫（字元樣式 af）","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].items[0].stem